            <title>[LU-21162] sanityn test_80a: migrate open files should failed with open files (2.15 client interop)</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21162</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;sanityn test_80a fails with "migrate open files should failed with open files" when the sanityn script comes from a b2_15 (2.15) client against master servers (clientversion=2.15 interop).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The b2_15 test_80a has no version gate: it expects "lfs migrate -m" of a directory containing an open file to fail. Since &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-18806" title="improve handling of open files and files with overflowed LinkEA in a migrate or restripe" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-18806"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-18806&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; (servers &amp;gt;= 2.16.50) migrating open files succeeds, so the old script's expectation is wrong and the test fails every time it runs in that configuration. The master script already gates on MDS1_VERSION &amp;gt;= 2.16.50.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Seen on change 70562 patchsets 1 and 2 (session 8a02541d-225b-454b-a8ed-d5dc1c150dbf, subtest d45b03e1-e7a6-4b1a-bc5c-bb5576748f91), change 67227 patchsets 7 to 9 (Sept 2026), and change 62059 (2025). Servers were 2.17.61 builds. The failing path is not touched by 70562: the test opens the file once with multiop O_c and has no exec open.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Possible fix: a lustre/tests/except/sanityn.ex on master so that 2.15 client scripts skip 80a against servers &amp;gt;= 2.16.50. An existing hidden EX ticket (EX-12526) may cover the same error but could not be read.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Raised by Patch Watcher run pw-engineer-70562-ps2-2ad8aa912137 on &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/70562" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/70562&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
